"5_store-friends.png", "id": "2329923427765315", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830904_2329923431098648_2586394273617079249_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Oc57yIco7t8Q7kNvwEFuabA&_nc_oc=AdoAEMFrVWBdVX84kGnj--rDFBvbrBruD5SK1_2MRuwppiLflOC4buaJO-fk47zDgmY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ5ilGk5QtzbGkhAqhnIluJEtSV5LU1N8eFyL9B0Hd-SA&oe=6B0C5775"}, {"file_name": "4_rook-mask.png", "id": "999027309914166", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654985632_999027313247499_8702763863975137621_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kqtJyK2yocoQ7kNvwHu-HvX&_nc_oc=Adqq0CL0xDw4dDoTHUUNDxWPe2GMTK7dGgLkESsL0maI0Gifccc-DIhqQZ2WoyqRX5E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSRhHc-WbmuVUphcUUm1s90fTuZGl0wPPFSbaCU9Y68cw&oe=6B0C6E69"}, {"file_name": "3_fable-boss-fight.png", "id": "1136172599267981", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596106838_1136172602601314_6820101275965995040_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l_tQrQRLUaMQ7kNvwH98w6a&_nc_oc=AdrHgRLdgzbc6B1mNHVmLFagib5XHyl5OROWr-HsoQpg6DOaiMOpG2FGQTt7P3zJ7hI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRzZU8670FfsN4jEDLlQfEYujG4HWP1-7_9dXTT7L3PGA&oe=6B0C839A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "1539587454862288", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595114885_1539587458195621_1583328559053055241_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-ka63hWEhSkQ7kNvwF9cJcQ&_nc_oc=AdqXiN29z8TI6eI8YigWvMtv67YBxAjc--scpPCVTAn2cSsxfQgxY2RTHS4yXPLI-KA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRlL9YmhuLeYAG7-nZk8YUUoW1dblx0lrKRPwhDgdQLKQ&oe=6B0C81FF"}, "display_name": "Fable Brawlers", "keywords": ["brawler", "coop", "fantasy", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "Once upon a time, the monsters got out of the storybooks. Time to punch them back in! \ud83d\udcd6\n\nTeam up with up to 10 friends online or play solo. New heroes start on a floating cloud island that teaches the basics.\n\n\ud83e\udd4a REAL FIGHTING\nThe faster you swing, the harder you hit. Guard, land combos and stagger the big ones.\n\n\ud83c\udfad WEAR THE LEGENDS\nBosses drop magic masks. Put one on and become that legend: throw monsters as Grimclaw or call down Thunder God's Judgment as Stormcaller. Masks level up, unlock abilities and come in six rarities, from Common to Fable.\n\n\ud83c\udf08 THE FABLE TRIAL\nCollect Fable Fragments from the toughest bosses, step through the rainbow portal and beat a giant snake, a fire dragon and the Shattered King to turn a Mystic mask into a Fable.\n\n\ud83d\udc3e ANIMAL COMPANIONS\nTire out a squirrel, kitten, puppy or rare baby dragon, catch it in a basket and heal it at home. It fights beside you and rides in your car or boat.\n\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f A WORLD TO EXPLORE\nThe Wildwood, Frostpeak and the Sunken Isles hold over twenty bosses, from the Goblin King to the Kraken.\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 DAILY CHALLENGES AND RANKS\nTwo new challenges a day and ranks to climb, all paying Coins.\n\n\ud83c\udfe1 HANG OUT AT HOME\nPaint your house, climb your Treehouse, dress up and boost your bike, hot rod or boat.\n\n\ud83d\udc8e FAIR AND FREE\nFree to play. Earn every mask by playing, or fast-track with a bundle. Nothing you buy is random.\n\n\ud83c\udfae COMFORT YOUR WAY\nStanding or roomscale. Arm or thumbstick movement, snap or smooth turning.", "short_description": "Punch your way through a storybook world with up to 10 friends! \ud83e\udd4a Win magic masks from bosses and become legends like Grimclaw the werewolf and Stormcaller, then take the rainbow portal to the Fable Trial and battle a fire dragon. \ud83c\udf08 Tame puppies, kittens and baby dragons to fight at your side, boost your hot rod across the map and make a house of your own. Free to play, and nothing you buy is random. \u2728"}]}, "developer_name": "CD", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://fablebrawlersvr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CD", "support_website_url": "https://fablebrawlersvr.com/feedback", "website_url": "https://fablebrawlersvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "1418765541326275"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835825_1764165098147248_3639362251126165539_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rMYiLkChVXAQ7kNvwFiPd52&_nc_oc=AdowiPZE6nRZzH1mIdUEkNohuebAkAVzPsCSvpGLGPDkwd4JA28Ozy_MRLkUE_jagaw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS47IO3yBwfcCirIaSz4IGcL4dYM6Vl0fKyUmLZiRtWFg&oe=6B0C7E64"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Fable Brawlers", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Adventure", "id": "2691890164460465"}], "release_date": 1793739360, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "1349579094911587", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"applicat